  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Supporting the LANL JPEG2000 Service at",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://african.lanl.gov/aDORe/projects/djatoka/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://african.lanl.gov/aDORe/projects/djatoka/",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "is a good example, but the goal of this improvement is to support that and other services by improving how SDefs/SDeps can work.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The problem is that a lot of existing http-exposed services have \"APIs\" of their own.  ANd it's hard to put those behind disseminations on digital objects.  Another example: Imagine a dissemination endpoint for an object that represented a collection, and you want to expose that object as an OAI-PMH repository endpoint.  For Fedora to be able to accomodate such a thing, we need to think more broadly about how dissemination calls can be made on objects.  This includes addressing both the \"path syntax\" and the set of possible http verbs that Fedora can expose as dissemination endpoints.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "One approach that has been mentioned is to make Fedora act more like an http proxy.  This also ties into some of Aaron Birkland's ideas here: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=8754366"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=8754366",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
